%% title: Slack Automation Sequence
%% description: Slash command execution lifecycle
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant Slack
    participant API
    participant Runner as Test Runner

    Dev->>Slack: /testauto run_tests licman staging
    Slack->>API: POST Webhook
    API-->>Slack: 200 OK (Queued)
    API->>Runner: Dispatch Job
    Runner-->>Slack: Post Results
